bds 6,1 "ADS-B aircraft status"
date 2026-10-14
preamble
    ADS-B aircraft status (typecode 28). Subtype 1 carries emergency
    and priority status plus squawk, subtype 2 carries an ACAS RA
    broadcast with the BDS 3,0 layout.
    Source: ICAO Doc 9871 (ICAO Annex 10 Vol. III) Mode S BDS register definition tables.

items

    TC "Type Code"
        definition
            ADS-B message type code.
        element 5
            unsigned integer
        remark
            28: aircraft status.

    SUBTYPE "Subtype"
        definition
            Aircraft status subtype.
        element 3
            table
                1: Emergency and priority status
                2: ACAS RA broadcast

    STATUSCASE "Status Variant"
        definition
            Status data, layout depends on the subtype.
        case SUBTYPE
            1:
                group
                    EMERG "Emergency State"
                        definition
                            Emergency or priority state.
                        element 3
                            table
                                0: No emergency
                                1: General emergency
                                2: Lifeguard and medical emergency
                                3: Minimum fuel
                                4: No communications
                                5: Unlawful interference
                                6: Downed aircraft
                                7: Reserved
                    SQUAWK_CODE "Identity Code"
                        definition
                            13-bit Mode S identity (squawk) code.
                        element 13
                            unsigned integer
                        remark
                            Decoded to a 4-digit octal squawk.
                    spare 32
            2:
                group
                    ARA0 "RA Active"
                        definition
                            Any resolution advisory active.
                        element 1
                            table
                                0: No RA issued
                                1: RA issued
                    ARA1 "Corrective RA"
                        definition
                            Corrective resolution advisory.
                        element 1
                            table
                                0: No
                                1: Yes
                    ARA2 "Downward Sense"
                        definition
                            Downward sense resolution advisory.
                        element 1
                            table
                                0: No
                                1: Yes
                    ARA3 "Increased Rate"
                        definition
                            Increased rate resolution advisory.
                        element 1
                            table
                                0: No
                                1: Yes
                    ARA4 "Sense Reversal"
                        definition
                            Sense reversal resolution advisory.
                        element 1
                            table
                                0: No
                                1: Yes
                    ARA5 "Altitude Crossing"
                        definition
                            Altitude crossing resolution advisory.
                        element 1
                            table
                                0: No
                                1: Yes
                    ARA6 "Positive RA"
                        definition
                            Positive resolution advisory.
                        element 1
                            table
                                0: No
                                1: Yes
                    spare 7
                    RAC0 "No Below"
                        definition
                            Do not pass below threat.
                        element 1
                            table
                                0: Allowed
                                1: Prohibited
                    RAC1 "No Above"
                        definition
                            Do not pass above threat.
                        element 1
                            table
                                0: Allowed
                                1: Prohibited
                    RAC2 "No Left"
                        definition
                            Do not turn left.
                        element 1
                            table
                                0: Allowed
                                1: Prohibited
                    RAC3 "No Right"
                        definition
                            Do not turn right.
                        element 1
                            table
                                0: Allowed
                                1: Prohibited
                    RATERM "RA Terminated"
                        definition
                            Resolution advisory terminated.
                        element 1
                            table
                                0: No
                                1: Yes
                    MULTITHREAT "Multiple Threat Encounter"
                        definition
                            Multiple threat encounter.
                        element 1
                            table
                                0: No
                                1: Yes
                    TTI "Threat Type Indicator"
                        definition
                            Format of the threat identity data.
                        element 2
                            table
                                0: No identity
                                1: ICAO address
                                2: Altitude, range and bearing
                                3: Reserved
                    TIDCASE "Threat Identity Variant"
                        definition
                            Threat identity data, layout depends on TTI.
                        case TTI
                            1:
                                group
                                    TID_ICAO "Threat ICAO Address"
                                        definition
                                            24-bit ICAO address of the threat.
                                        element 24
                                            raw
                                    spare 2
                            2:
                                group
                                    THREAT_ALT "Threat Altitude Code"
                                        definition
                                            13-bit altitude code of the threat.
                                        element 13
                                            unsigned integer
                                        remark
                                            Decoded to feet via the altcode rules.
                                    THREAT_RANGE "Threat Range"
                                        definition
                                            Slant range to the threat.
                                        element 7
                                            unsigned integer
                                        remark
                                            Nautical miles = (raw - 1) / 10.
                                    THREAT_BEARING "Threat Bearing"
                                        definition
                                            Bearing to the threat.
                                        element 6
                                            unsigned integer
                                        remark
                                            Degrees = 6 * (raw - 1) + 3.
                            default:
                                group
                                    spare 26
            default:
                group
                    spare 48
